  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed rear outrigger extension and roof terrace with balustrades, by reason of its position, size, design and external appearance, would be an intrusive development, out of scale and character with this Wellesley Road conservation area failing to maintain and enhance the appearance, as well as having a serious and adverse effect on the amenities enjoyed by occupants of neighbouring properties by loss of daylight, an increased sense of enclosure and increased activity, noise and general disturbance. Thus, it is contrary to the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines, Local Plan policies CC1, CC2, CC4, SC7 and the intent of NPPF."
